{% comment %}
  The supplied 1920px mockup is used only as the fallback crop for the creator/product
  image because no isolated portrait asset was attached. Replacing Creator image in the
  Theme Editor will use that image while preserving the layout.

  The supplied text attachments contain existing Home Revamp section code rather than literal
  style.css/base.css files, so this section reuses the same theme font variables, button class,
  and preset conventions visible in those files.

  Theme typography and Home Revamp preset conventions follow the supplied section files:
  :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}
  :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}
{% endcomment %}